menu "Bop"

    config BOP_TIMEZONE
        string "Time zone of the screensaver clock"
        default "UTC0"
        help
            A POSIX TZ string. The screensaver clock and the clock line of the
            SD card log use it. Examples: "UTC0", "CET-1CEST,M3.5.0,M10.5.0/3"
            for Central European time with summer time, "<+01>-1" for UTC+1
            all year. Set it for one board in the untracked file
            firmware/sdkconfig.local.defaults.

endmenu
